  "notes": [
    "Guards are semantic conditions, not existing API names.",
    "Same-screen cases describe denied, pending or local actions and need not be graph edges.",
    "Modal/focus/input are orthogonal to screens; SETTINGS and FEDERATION store origin; CATALOG opened from PAUSE after safe close returns MAIN.",
